  "measure_description": "Preliminary values measured with the Powercalc Measure app (record.jsonl, 2026-10-04) on a Shelly Plug S Gen3 feeding the base station. The device is sold under the MOVA brand, a sister brand of Dreame, and is integrated through the Dreame Vacuum integration, which is why it is listed under the Dreame manufacturer here. Auto-empty 322 W (single partial cycle; the automated validator flagged ~22% deviation against its prediction, so this value is provisional), charging curve recorded from 10% to 100% (33-36 W, dropping to 15.8 W above ~95%), washing 17.1 W, drying 12.0 W, standby/idle/docked 3.16 W. While the robot vacuums it runs on battery, so the station only draws 0.75 W. All values are real measurements; the auto-empty branch should be re-measured with a complete emptying cycle.",
